  "description": "Subject: Ability Overview \u2013 Flame Burst & Stone Shield  \n\n**Flame Burst (ID\u202f101)** \u2013 a Tier\u202f1 weapon skill placed at order\u202f10 in specialization\u202f5. Its core description reads: \u201cUnleashes a burst of fire that damages enemies.\u201d The ability\u2019s primary facts list a **Damage** entry (icon\u202fdamage_icon.png) with a 12.5\u202f% value and a zero\u2011second duration, alongside a **Burn Duration** fact (icon\u202fburn_icon.png) that applies the\u202fBurn\u202fstatus for\u202f5\u202fseconds. The associated active skill, also named *Flame Burst* (skill ID\u202f201, chat link\u202f[&AAEAAAA=]), uses the icon\u202fflame_burst_skill.png and carries the flags *Projectile* and *Instant*. Within the skill, two facts are detailed: **Fire Damage** (icon\u202ffire_damage.png) dealing 250 points of damage, hit\u202fonce, with no lasting duration; and **Burn Effect** (icon\u202fburn_effect.png) lasting\u202f5\u202fseconds. When the character possesses trait\u202f301, the skill gains the traited fact **Empowered Damage** (icon\u202fempowered.png) with a zero\u2011second duration. The ability\u2019s own icon is\u202fflame_burst_icon.png.  \n\n**Stone Shield (ID\u202f102)** \u2013 a Tier\u202f2 armor skill positioned at order\u202f20 in specialization\u202f6. Its description states: \u201cCreates a protective barrier of stone, reducing incoming damage.\u201d The sole fact for this ability is **Damage Reduction** (icon\u202fshield_icon.png) granting a 20\u202f% mitigation. The active skill, also called *Stone Shield* (skill ID\u202f202, chat link\u202f[&AAGAAAA=]), uses the icon\u202fstone_shield_skill.png and has no special flags. Its fact list includes **Shield Strength** (icon\u202fshield_strength.png) providing 150 points of shielding for\u202f10\u202fseconds. No traited facts are attached to this skill. The overarching ability icon is\u202fstone_shield_icon.png.",
